<title>INDIA: India's ITC sets 4.00 rupee/shr dividend.</title>
<headline>India's ITC sets 4.00 rupee/shr dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's ITC Ltd on Saturday announced a dividend of four rupees per ordinary share for the year 1996/97 (April-March) against 2.50 rupees paid in the previous year.  </p>
<p>The company's board announced the dividend after its meeting in the eastern city of Calcutta, the tobacco and hotel conglomerate said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
